# Same Supabase project as the mobile apps and apps/admin. ANON key only —
# every query runs as the signed-in senior/family member under RLS, so a bug
# here cannot read more than that person's role and consent grants allow.
#
# The service-role key must NEVER appear in this file or in this app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
